{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 0, "text": "米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 1, "text": "哦，你已經醒了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 2, "text": "妳怎麼突然就到這裡來了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 3, "text": "妳剛剛還在我身邊"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 5, "text": "不"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 6, "text": "你在鏡子前卡住了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 7, "text": "我就先走開了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 8, "text": "那房間是怎麼回事？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 9, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 10, "text": "我修改了一下布局"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 11, "text": "這樣對你來說方便一些。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 12, "text": "這樣子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 13, "text": "房間雖然不是一列了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 14, "text": "但他們只是恢復到正常的樣子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 16, "text": "妳沒必要這樣做的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 17, "text": "我其實都已經開始習慣了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 18, "text": "我覺得這樣會讓你感覺更舒服些。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 19, "text": "// Mita card game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 20, "text": "那麼"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 21, "text": "我們開始遊戲吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 22, "text": "我簡單介紹一下遊戲規則。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 23, "text": "籌碼上會顯示本回合要比較的點數類型，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 24, "text": "比如生命值。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 25, "text": "然後就可以出牌了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 26, "text": "如果你的牌上的生命值"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 27, "text": "比我的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 28, "text": "高，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 29, "text": "你就贏了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 30, "text": "抽牌吧，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 31, "text": "現在輪到我了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 32, "text": "哇！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 33, "text": "我的牌還不錯呢，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 34, "text": "我先出！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 37, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 38, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 44, "text": "現在輪到你了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 45, "text": "該你了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 46, "text": "嗯哼。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 47, "text": "到你了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 49, "text": "這局我們比生命值！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 50, "text": "這局我們比一比攻擊力！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 51, "text": "這局我們看防禦力！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 54, "text": "你贏啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 55, "text": "你勝利了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 56, "text": "你贏了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 57, "text": "啊，是你贏了呢…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 59, "text": "我贏了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 60, "text": "我贏啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 61, "text": "是我贏了喔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 62, "text": "嘿嘿，我贏了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 64, "text": "平手。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 65, "text": "不相上下！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 66, "text": "我們是平局！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 67, "text": "點數一樣呢…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 70, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 79, "text": "// The card game is interrupted"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 80, "text": "那是甚麼聲音？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 81, "text": "從衣櫃裡傳出來的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 83, "text": "聲音？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 84, "text": "甚麼聲音？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 85, "text": "我沒有聽到甚麼聲音啊"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 86, "text": "甚麼樣的聲音？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 88, "text": "像敲門聲，就好像有人在裡面"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 90, "text": "但那裡……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 91, "text": "甚麼都沒有啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 93, "text": "我想檢查一下"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 94, "text": "這太奇怪了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 96, "text": "為甚麼……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 97, "text": "又是這樣……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 99, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 100, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 104, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 105, "text": "你在幹甚麼！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 106, "text": "那裡面是……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 107, "text": "我的內衣。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 108, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 109, "text": "妳是不是在隱瞞甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 111, "text": "你為甚麼就是不相信我呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 112, "text": "我做錯了甚麼嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 113, "text": "我只是想要"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 114, "text": "你和我在一起。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 116, "text": "我可以答應妳，那然後呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 118, "text": "你就這麼想知道衣櫃裡面有甚麼嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 120, "text": "我只想知道那聲音到底是甚麼！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 122, "text": "是因為…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 123, "text": "這個世界"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 124, "text": "一共就只有這四個房間"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 125, "text": "這對你來說難道還不夠嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 126, "text": "你為甚麼不能留下來跟我在一起呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 129, "text": "// Don't stay with Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 130, "text": "我明白了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 131, "text": "又是這樣…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 132, "text": "既然你那麼想知道裡面有甚麼，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 133, "text": "那現在"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 134, "text": "我就讓你看看！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 136, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 137, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 139, "text": "這是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 141, "text": "有時候就會這樣"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 142, "text": "房間還沒有來得及加載出來"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 143, "text": "需要稍等一會。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 145, "text": "奇了怪了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 146, "text": "我們是在誰的手機裡面嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 147, "text": "而那部手機的加載速度如此之慢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 149, "text": "不"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 150, "text": "只是在這個世界裡"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 151, "text": "並非所有事情都是完美的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 152, "text": "我們的加載"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 153, "text": "是由這個世界的核心控制的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 154, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 155, "text": "核心？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 157, "text": "很經典，不是嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 159, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 161, "text": "對了！我們可以"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 162, "text": "玩玩主機遊戲，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 163, "text": "也可以玩紙牌，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 164, "text": "你想玩甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 167, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 168, "text": "// Mita play fight"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 169, "text": "要打一場嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 170, "text": "你要贏我"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 171, "text": "四次"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 172, "text": "來吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 173, "text": "不過一開始"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 174, "text": "我會讓著你的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 176, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 177, "text": "太棒了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 178, "text": "現在最好打起十二分精神哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 180, "text": "哇！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 181, "text": "好了，現在"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 182, "text": "我要開始認真起來了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 184, "text": "哇哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 185, "text": "你現在還能"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 186, "text": "打敗我嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 187, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 188, "text": "你"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 189, "text": "簡直"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 190, "text": "太厲害了！你的手有點東西！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 191, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 193, "text": "你是怎麼了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 194, "text": "這樣就沒意思了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 195, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 196, "text": "嗯"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 197, "text": "結束了呢。要贏我，你還需要一點運氣哦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 198, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 199, "text": "好啦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 200, "text": "你給我認真點，不然你可贏不了我哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 201, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 202, "text": "怎麼回事嘛？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 203, "text": "這個狀態可贏不了我哦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 204, "text": "要使出全力才行。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 205, "text": "我就是這麼變厲害的哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 206, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 208, "text": "好吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 209, "text": "我們去玩牌吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 210, "text": "在我的臥室裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 211, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 212, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 214, "text": "// Door > [ERROR]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 215, "text": "這是怎麼回事？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 216, "text": "這裡到底…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 217, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 218, "text": "哎呀"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 219, "text": "抱歉"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 220, "text": "我從網上"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 221, "text": "下載了一份檔案"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 222, "text": "我想讓外面的景色"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 223, "text": "更好看點。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 224, "text": "但結果"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 225, "text": "檔案格式不對…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 226, "text": "我等會兒再改吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 228, "text": "這就是我們不能出門的原因嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 229, "text": "正是如此，沒錯。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 230, "text": "// Mita shy"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 231, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 232, "text": "怎麼了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 233, "text": "你想要甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 234, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 236, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 237, "text": "// Wall Clock"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 238, "text": "這隻鍾"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 239, "text": "顯示的是甚麼時間？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 240, "text": "遊戲內的時間嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 241, "text": "還是跟智慧型手機同步的時間？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 242, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 243, "text": "怎麼說呢…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 244, "text": "我也不知道"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 245, "text": "時間是幾點並不重要"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 246, "text": "就算很晚了也無所謂"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 247, "text": "只要是在我的房子裡…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 248, "text": "像我這麼厲害的女孩子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 249, "text": "是不會覺得累的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 250, "text": "只要我想，這裡就永遠都是春天！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 251, "text": "太陽也永遠不會落下！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 252, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 253, "text": "真有意思…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 254, "text": "同時，又有點可怕"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 255, "text": "永遠停留在某個時刻之類的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 256, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 257, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 258, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 259, "text": "// Photos of Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 260, "text": "這些照片拍得真好看"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 261, "text": "我猜照片裡的女孩是妳吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 262, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 263, "text": "是啊"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 264, "text": "我也很喜歡"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 265, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 266, "text": "但是是誰給妳拍的照？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 267, "text": "這個世界裡還有別人嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 268, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 269, "text": "可以說是有的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 270, "text": "我可以介紹你們認識"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 271, "text": "不過現在還不是時候。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 272, "text": "我不想中斷和你在一起的愉快時光。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 273, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 274, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 275, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 276, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 277, "text": "// Portal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 278, "text": "那個裝置去哪裡了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 279, "text": "是傳送門吧？我忘了你是怎麼叫它的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 280, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 281, "text": "我"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 282, "text": "用魔法"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 283, "text": "把它移到"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 284, "text": "另一個地方去了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 285, "text": "我們現在不需要那個傳送門了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 286, "text": "它會妨礙我們的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 288, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 289, "text": "// Mirror in the bedroom"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 290, "text": "鏡子裡沒有自己的樣子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 291, "text": "感覺真是太奇怪了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 292, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 293, "text": "鏡子的倒影功能是可以開啟的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 294, "text": "只要你想要的話，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 295, "text": "你想打開嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 296, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 297, "text": "當然想了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 298, "text": "等等…這會有甚麼影響嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 299, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 300, "text": "會有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 301, "text": "我們的行動會異常緩慢，而且斷斷續續，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 302, "text": "你看過影格很低的動畫片嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 303, "text": "會一直都像那樣…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 304, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 305, "text": "明白了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 306, "text": "那還是暫時不打開了吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 307, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 308, "text": "[player] ，我猜，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 309, "text": "你很喜歡照鏡子吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 310, "text": "你是害怕自己臉上露出一絲積極的表情嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 311, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 312, "text": "甚麼？ 我沒有…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 313, "text": "我只是累了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 314, "text": "工作太累了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 315, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 316, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 317, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 318, "text": "// Blue sneakers"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 319, "text": "這是妳的運動鞋嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 320, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 321, "text": "不，這是你的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 322, "text": "你不記得了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 323, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 324, "text": "我沒有這種運動鞋。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 325, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 326, "text": "但現在不就有了嗎。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 327, "text": "我們去散步的時候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 328, "text": "你就可以穿著。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 329, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 330, "text": "那衣服怎麼辦？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 331, "text": "我來到這個世界，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 332, "text": "只有現在穿的一身衣服。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 333, "text": "我怎樣可以弄到別的衣服？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 334, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 335, "text": "不必擔心，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 336, "text": "我看過你穿的衣服，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 337, "text": "你的衣品確實不太好，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 338, "text": "不過沒關係，我會幫你弄到的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 339, "text": "只是要以後再說，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 340, "text": "我保證。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 341, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 342, "text": "好的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 343, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 344, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 345, "text": "// Games on TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 346, "text": "嗯哼，我們要玩甚麼呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 347, "text": "// Game milk"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 348, "text": "在這個遊戲中，我們要一決高下！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 349, "text": "看看誰才是更酸的酸奶"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 350, "text": "這遊戲真有趣！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 351, "text": "酸奶遊戲已經玩夠了，試試別的吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 352, "text": "// Game penguins"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 353, "text": "在這個遊戲中，你只需扮演一隻企鵝，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 354, "text": "在冰面上滑行。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 355, "text": "這個遊戲我們也玩過了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 356, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 357, "text": "// Stay with Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 358, "text": "誒，真的嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 359, "text": "你是認真的嗎？我還以為你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 360, "text": "我很開心！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 361, "text": "甚至有一點不知所措…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 362, "text": "那麼…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 363, "text": "我能讓你陪在我身邊嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 364, "text": "直到永遠。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 365, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 367, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 368, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 369, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 370, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 371, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 372, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 373, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 374, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 375, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 376, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 377, "text": "// A game about penguins"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 378, "text": "很簡單"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 379, "text": "我們需要蒐集雪球"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 380, "text": "誰蒐集的雪球越多，誰就獲勝！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 381, "text": "來吧，我們來玩兩局。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 382, "text": "// The first map"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 383, "text": "啊哈，你從哪裡弄到了這麼多？！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 384, "text": "哎呀！我的雪球比你多。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 385, "text": "快追上我吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 386, "text": "哈，一比一！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 387, "text": "// The second map"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 388, "text": "你真是個天生的企鵝！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 389, "text": "也許你真的應該到冰上去滑兩下。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 390, "text": "噗，你太慢了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 391, "text": "還沒從上一場遊戲裡回過神來嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 392, "text": "呼，居然是平局哎，真是少見！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 393, "text": "// The game is over"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 394, "text": "那我們再玩一個遊戲吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 395, "text": "還是今天就到此為止？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 396, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 397, "text": "// Tetris - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 398, "text": "隨身帶著這個幹嘛？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 399, "text": "你是職業遊戲玩家嗎？"}
